Z||000003||maryjane||08-18-2001||08:33 PM||||Beaverman, In the future, put a short description in the subject that tells what your problem is. If someone reads the subject and is familar with the problem they are much more likely to stop and try to help.<BR>Next, do a little search thru the Tech section archives. If you type in Help,pls, you may come up with anything and evrything. Do a search with the keywords "Low power" & you may have a better chance for good info. Not criticizing, I've used "help" myself. Now, What year,eng etc. Did your check eng light come on? Any codes set by ecm? Reply back and let us know. Could be ign mod in dist, plugged fuel filter, bad 02, vac line leaking, lots of things. Help us out  a little.||||reg||1
